<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-12638] Classes persisted by DistributedMetaStorage are not IgniteDTO</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-12638</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;This has to be fixed to simplify future modification of component.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;DistributedMetaStorageHistoryItem and&#160;DistributedMetaStorageVersion will be persisted on disc so we need to have a reliable way to read them even when classes will be updated in the future.&#160;IgniteDataTransferObject is the standard option for such cases - it allows versioning of serialization format.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
